        Bus payment can also be made contactlessly using a bank card or smartphone.
    </string>

    <!-- Tab 1: Discounts -->
    <string name="section_reduced_fare_beneficiaries">Reduced Fare &amp; Free Travel Eligible Users</string>
    <string name="title_who_pays_reduced">Eligible for Reduced Fare (50%)</string>
    <string name="desc_who_pays_reduced">
        • Students of Greek public universities (with academic ID)\n
        • Primary &amp; Secondary Education students\n
        • Youth aged 7 to 18\n
        • Seniors over 65 years old (with national ID)\n
        • Large families / parents of 3+ children (with special ID/card)
    </string>

    <string name="title_who_travels_free">Eligible for Free Travel</string>
    <string name="desc_who_travels_free">
        • Children up to 6 years old (accompanied by an adult)\n
        • Unemployed individuals registered with DYPA (with recent digital certificate)\n
        • Persons with Disabilities (PwD) upon presenting special pass
    </string>

    <!-- Tab 2: Sales Points -->
    <string name="section_where_to_buy">Where to buy tickets or passes</string>
    <string name="title_thesscard">Personalized &amp; Anonymous Card (ThessCard / ThessTicket)</string>
    <string name="desc_thesscard">
        Personalized ThessCard issuance at OASTH ticket offices and Metro stations with ID,
        SSN (AMKA), and discount supporting documents. Top up via ATVMs, ticket offices, or contactlessly on buses.
    </string>

    <string name="title_physical_points">Physical Sales Outlets &amp; Ticket Offices</string>
    <string name="desc_physical_points">
        OASTH ticket offices (Aristotelous Sq., New Railway Station, Airport, etc.), Thessaloniki
        Metro ticket offices, as well as selected retail locations (kiosks, convenience stores).
    </string>

    <!-- Tab 3: Fines -->
    <string name="section_fines_title">Ticket Inspection &amp; Fines</string>
    <string name="title_no_ticket_fine">Failure to validate ticket / pass</string>
    <string name="desc_no_ticket_fine">
        The fine for non-possession or non-validation of a ticket equals 60 times
        the standard ticket price (€60.00 for regular, €30.00 for reduced).
    </string>

    <string name="title_fine_discount">50% discount on payment</string>
    <string name="desc_fine_discount">
        The fine is reduced by 50% if paid within 10 business days from the date of issue
        at the Agency\'s ticket offices or via bank deposit.
    </string>

